ASSISTANTS WANTED FOR NEW MULTI-MEDIA GAME

Multiplayer and Action game fans are currently sought out by the
Novalink Interactive Services to be Assistants in the new game product
Cyber Corps.

Cyber Corps is a fast paced action/skill game somewhat related to the
"Capture-the-flag" concept.  However, there are multiple flags,
program-controlled mutants, and players on the enemy team who will try
to kill you or get in your way!

ANSI emulation and PC Graphic Front-End Software featuring VGA Graphics
and digital sound are the two ways to play.

Accepted assistants will be granted a free Novalink account, but will be
expected to spend at least five hours in the game a week.  Most of these
hours will be scheduled at certain times to keep a solid rotation of
people in the game for providing opposition, and helping customers.  You
must access Novalink through the Internet ONLY, and love the way this
game seems to be like.  If you think this position is for you, please
respond with netmail saying that you are interested in becoming a Cyber
Corps assistant.

For more information write corps@novalink.com

